<title>GREECE: U.S. EMBASSY TO CLOSE ON VETERANS DAY, MONDAY NOV 11.</title>
<headline>U.S. EMBASSY TO CLOSE ON VETERANS DAY, MONDAY NOV 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Embassy in Athens, the U.S consulates general in Athens and Thessaloniki and all U.S officies in Greece except for the American library will be closed on Monday, November 11, 1996 in observance of the Veterans Day, it said in a statement. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
